"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,P,M,\\leq_P\\in V\">\\(R,P,M,\\leq_P\\in V\\)</span> (residue, forcing, model, and order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset.md\">58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dense}\">\\(\\mathrm{Dense}\\)</span> (dense-subset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"681e6314e26cdd0b\" href=\"?note=681e6314e26cdd0b\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-dense.md\">../batch10/58-df-dense.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compatible}_S(d,r,P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Compatible}_S(d,r,P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> (fully parameterized compatibility predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2ad4b32e9e2eb12a\" href=\"?note=2ad4b32e9e2eb12a\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-compatible.md\">../batch08/58-df-compatible.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10PropernessResidue}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10PropernessResidue}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}properness\\text{-}residue} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10PropernessResidue}_S(R,P,\\leq_P,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\nR=\\bigl\\{p\\in P\\bigm|\n\\forall D\\in M\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Dense}(D,P,\\leq_P)\\to\n\\forall r\\in P\\;\\bigl(\nr\\leq_Pp\\to\n\\exists d\\in D\\cap M\\;\\mathrm{Compatible}_S(d,r,P,\\leq_P)\n\\bigr)\n\\bigr)\n\\bigr\\}\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}properness\\text{-}residue} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10PropernessResidue}_S(R,P,\\leq_P,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\nR=\\bigl\\{p\\in P\\bigm|\n\\forall D\\in M\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Dense}(D,P,\\leq_P)\\to\n\\forall r\\in P\\;\\bigl(\nr\\leq_Pp\\to\n\\exists d\\in D\\cap M\\;\\mathrm{Compatible}_S(d,r,P,\\leq_P)\n\\bigr)\n\\bigr)\n\\bigr\\}\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The residue now depends on the forcing order and expands the properness master-condition clause from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a>; the nonexistent three-place <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MGeneric}\">\\(\\operatorname{MGeneric}\\)</span> symbol is not used.</li>\n<li>相容性调用现与上游四元签名一致；载体和序关系均不能由下标隐去。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-proper.md","status":"resolved","id":"8935dcac821c0104","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-dense.md","status":"resolved","id":"681e6314e26cdd0b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-dense.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-compatible.md","statu